@base = http://localhost:5121

### Process liveness; available even without dependencies
GET {{base}}/health/live

### Dependency readiness in full mode
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### Explainable plan: specialist must be preserved for the specialist slot
POST {{base}}/api/v1/planning/preview
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: portfolio-specialist-plan

< ./specialist-plan.json

### Reserve the resulting resources in full mode
POST {{base}}/api/v1/allocate
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: portfolio-reservation
Idempotency-Key: portfolio-reservation-001

{
  "projectId": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "resourceIds": ["30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001", "30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002"],
  "periodFrom": "2026-10-20T08:00:00Z",
  "periodTo": "2026-10-20T10:00:00Z"
}

### Without a key, repeating the reservation returns 409 Conflict
POST {{base}}/api/v1/allocate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "resourceIds": ["30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"],
  "periodFrom": "2026-10-20T08:00:00Z",
  "periodTo": "2026-10-20T10:00:00Z"
}

### Repeating the first request with its original key returns the original IDs and 201
POST {{base}}/api/v1/allocate
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: portfolio-reservation-001

{
  "projectId": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "resourceIds": ["30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002", "30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"],
  "periodFrom": "2026-10-20T11:00:00+03:00",
  "periodTo": "2026-10-20T13:00:00+03:00"
}
